WEBVTT

45:02.059 --> 45:06.438
I remember how scared I was when
Ned brought me up here for the first time.

45:08.649 --> 45:10.234
Hello, little dove.

45:11.235 --> 45:13.404
But you are a beauty.

45:13.529 --> 45:15.823
- How old are you?
- Thirteen, Your Grace.

45:15.948 --> 45:18.534
You're tall. Still growing?

45:18.659 --> 45:20.494
I think so, Your Grace.

45:20.619 --> 45:22.746
And have you bled yet?

45:27.876 --> 45:29.336
No, Your Grace.
